00:37:52.032 --> 00:37:54.368
&lt;b&gt;So the offer I received was UCLA's offer&lt;/b&gt;

00:37:54.935 --> 00:37:58.272
&lt;b&gt;And I got my visa sorted and was ready to enroll&lt;/b&gt;

