&lt;b&gt;Right now I can't tell you either&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:13.854 --> 00:38:14.922
&lt;b&gt;I don't know either&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:14.922 --> 00:38:16.390
&lt;b&gt;Because he was also in interviews at that time&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:16.457 --> 00:38:17.591
&lt;b&gt;Oh, really?&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:18.359 --> 00:38:19.827
