00:38:19.827 --> 00:38:20.728
&lt;b&gt;You have a few options&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:20.728 --> 00:38:23.831
&lt;b&gt;One is you can stay at UCLA&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:23.831 --> 00:38:27.268
&lt;b&gt;and I'll hand you over to other professors&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:27.735 --> 00:38:28.836
&lt;b&gt;Or you can wait&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:28.836 --> 00:38:31.038
&lt;b&gt;and see how my situation works out&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:31.071 --> 00:38:32.273
&lt;b&gt;And possibly&lt;/b&gt;

