&lt;b&gt;So did you wait?&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:37.811 --> 00:38:40.581
&lt;b&gt;Or did you immediately say, I choose you?&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:40.581 --> 00:38:41.582
&lt;b&gt;I basically said&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:41.582 --> 00:38:43.784
&lt;b&gt;I immediately said, I choose you&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:44.351 --> 00:38:45.619
&lt;b&gt;You didn't care about the school?&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:45.819 --> 00:38:46.754
&lt;b&gt;Um&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:46.787 --> 00:38:49.156
&lt;b&gt;I think I don't care about the school&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:49.156 --> 00:38:50.424
&lt;b&gt;And I still think&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:50.424 --> 00:38:51.625
&lt;b&gt;I think all these things are very interesting&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:51.625 --> 00:38:55.396
&lt;b&gt;Because back then if you looked at UCSD&lt;/b&gt;

