00:38:56.764 --> 00:38:58.165
&lt;b&gt;nothing compared to UCLA&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:58.165 --> 00:38:59.199
&lt;b&gt;Mm&lt;/b&gt;

00:38:59.199 --> 00:39:01.035
&lt;b&gt;Now it's completely different&lt;/b&gt;

