&lt;b&gt;is already among the top few&lt;/b&gt;

00:39:15.215 --> 00:39:16.617
&lt;b&gt;Back then, it was completely different&lt;/b&gt;

00:39:16.917 --> 00:39:17.451
&lt;b&gt;Back then&lt;/b&gt;

00:39:17.451 --> 00:39:19.853
&lt;b&gt;And I actually always wanted to collaborate with a professor&lt;/b&gt;

00:39:19.853 --> 00:39:20.821
&lt;b&gt;named Serge Belongie&lt;/b&gt;

