&lt;b&gt;my childhood dream was actually to become a film director&lt;/b&gt;

02:52:07.747 --> 02:52:08.648
&lt;b&gt;right&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;b&gt;mm&lt;/b&gt;

02:52:08.814 --> 02:52:09.882
&lt;b&gt;childhood dream&lt;/b&gt;

02:52:09.882 --> 02:52:11.250
&lt;b&gt;no, no&lt;/b&gt;

