&lt;b&gt;there's one thing this book talks about&lt;/b&gt;

02:53:25.791 --> 02:53:30.229
&lt;b&gt;that I think is particularly interesting&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;b&gt;it talks about&lt;/b&gt;

02:53:30.296 --> 02:53:34.734
&lt;b&gt;what makes a good story&lt;/b&gt;

02:53:34.767 --> 02:53:37.069
&lt;b&gt;it's not&lt;/b&gt;

02:53:37.436 --> 02:53:39.839
&lt;b&gt;a story that has no conflict from beginning to end&lt;/b&gt;

02:53:39.839 --> 02:53:41.240
&lt;b&gt;a good story must be driven by conflict&lt;/b&gt;

02:53:41.607 --> 02:53:43.142
&lt;b&gt;and through conflict to discover&lt;/b&gt;

02:53:43.442 --> 02:53:47.179
&lt;b&gt;the true character's core&lt;/b&gt;

02:53:47.179 --> 02:53:48.881
&lt;b&gt;mm&lt;/b&gt;

02:53:49.482 --> 02:53:53.786
&lt;b&gt;and in research&lt;/b&gt;

02:53:53.786 --> 02:53:56.022
&lt;b&gt;it's the same thing&lt;/b&gt;

02:53:56.689 --> 02:53:58.624
&lt;b&gt;a good research paper&lt;/b&gt;

02:53:58.758 --> 02:53:59.458
&lt;b&gt;must also set up the conflict&lt;/b&gt;

02:53:59.458 --> 02:54:01.694
&lt;b&gt;and then through conflict&lt;/b&gt;

02:54:01.694 --> 02:54:02.962
&lt;b&gt;you discover the core of this problem&lt;/b&gt;

02:54:02.962 --> 02:54:03.896
&lt;b&gt;and the solution to this problem&lt;/b&gt;

02:54:03.896 --> 02:54:05.631
&lt;b&gt;right&lt;/b&gt;

02:54:05.931 --> 02:54:06.799
&lt;b&gt;so I think this book&lt;/b&gt;

02:54:06.799 --> 02:54:09.468
&lt;b&gt;has a lot of profound insights&lt;/b&gt;

02:54:09.602 --> 02:54:11.837
&lt;b&gt;including about life&lt;/b&gt;

02:54:12.271 --> 02:54:12.738
&lt;b&gt;mm&lt;/b&gt;

02:54:12.738 --> 02:54:16.142
&lt;b&gt;and I think the concept of conflict in the book&lt;/b&gt;

02:54:16.242 --> 02:54:16.842
&lt;b&gt;is actually similar to what I was just talking about&lt;/b&gt;

