&lt;b&gt;but the former&lt;/b&gt;

03:04:51.410 --> 03:04:52.744
&lt;b&gt;this more elegant solution&lt;/b&gt;

03:04:52.744 --> 03:04:54.813
&lt;b&gt;the simpler solution is always better&lt;/b&gt;

03:04:54.880 --> 03:04:57.049
&lt;b&gt;I think this is also a kind of research taste in a sense&lt;/b&gt;

03:04:57.049 --> 03:04:58.350
&lt;b&gt;so we found, hey&lt;/b&gt;

03:04:58.350 --> 03:05:00.685
&lt;b&gt;this thing is both simple and it works&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:00.752 --> 03:05:01.787
&lt;b&gt;and scalable&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:01.887 --> 03:05:03.155
&lt;b&gt;and efficient&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:03.622 --> 03:05:04.856
&lt;b&gt;so it seems like this thing&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:04.856 --> 03:05:06.992
&lt;b&gt;is the direction we should be pursuing&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:06.992 --> 03:05:09.461
&lt;b&gt;so also a month in advance&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:09.461 --> 03:05:11.063
&lt;b&gt;and then we went to work on this&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:11.063 --> 03:05:11.563
&lt;b&gt;mm&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:11.563 --> 03:05:14.399
&lt;b&gt;and at that point we were competing for a lot of resources&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:14.399 --> 03:05:14.966
&lt;b&gt;people said&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:14.966 --> 03:05:17.035
&lt;b&gt;why are you working on this?&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:17.035 --> 03:05:19.037
&lt;b&gt;we need to consolidate resources now&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:19.071 --> 03:05:20.539
&lt;b&gt;and we need to do something more meaningful&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:20.539 --> 03:05:21.606
&lt;b&gt;a bigger project&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:21.606 --> 03:05:22.741
&lt;b&gt;for example&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:22.741 --> 03:05:24.409
&lt;b&gt;nobody knows&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:24.409 --> 03:05:25.677
&lt;b&gt;so we need these alignment&lt;/b&gt;

