&lt;b&gt;wouldn't be an important part of this critical path&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:33.085 --> 03:05:33.885
&lt;b&gt;an important&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:34.086 --> 03:05:36.688
&lt;b&gt;key member on this critical path&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:36.688 --> 03:05:37.255
&lt;b&gt;right&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:37.255 --> 03:05:40.892
&lt;b&gt;so there was a lot of opposition&lt;/b&gt;

03:05:40.892 --> 03:05:42.761
&lt;b&gt;but I felt I could see&lt;/b&gt;

