03:08:29.394 --> 03:08:32.397
&lt;b&gt;yes&lt;/b&gt;

03:08:32.397 --> 03:08:34.399
&lt;b&gt;right, so this was something we were very proud of&lt;/b&gt;

03:08:34.399 --> 03:08:35.400
&lt;b&gt;mm&lt;/b&gt;

