&lt;b&gt;use DiT as the backbone&lt;/b&gt;

03:08:44.542 --> 03:08:45.210
&lt;b&gt;mm&lt;/b&gt;

03:08:45.210 --> 03:08:46.444
&lt;b&gt;so I think this was a very important paper&lt;/b&gt;

03:08:46.444 --> 03:08:48.446
&lt;b&gt;mm&lt;/b&gt;

