&lt;b&gt;games are a massive market&lt;/b&gt;

03:10:02.153 --> 03:10:05.457
&lt;b&gt;right&lt;/b&gt;

03:10:05.490 --> 03:10:06.057
&lt;b&gt;so there's a lot of commercial potential as well&lt;/b&gt;

03:10:06.057 --> 03:10:08.159
&lt;b&gt;mm&lt;/b&gt;

03:10:08.159 --> 03:10:10.095
&lt;b&gt;right, so that's kind of the story&lt;/b&gt;

03:10:10.261 --> 03:10:12.630
&lt;b&gt;behind starting the company&lt;/b&gt;

03:10:12.630 --> 03:10:13.398
&lt;b&gt;mm&lt;/b&gt;

03:10:13.465 --> 03:10:15.233
&lt;b&gt;so what has the journey been like&lt;/b&gt;

03:10:15.533 --> 03:10:16.334
&lt;b&gt;since you started the company?&lt;/b&gt;

03:10:16.334 --> 03:10:18.770
&lt;b&gt;mm&lt;/b&gt;

03:10:18.770 --> 03:10:21.039
&lt;b&gt;I think&lt;/b&gt;

03:10:21.239 --> 03:10:22.741
&lt;b&gt;building a company is very different from doing research&lt;/b&gt;

03:10:22.807 --> 03:10:25.777
&lt;b&gt;mm&lt;/b&gt;

