&lt;b&gt;and how should we solve it&lt;/b&gt;

03:34:33.657 --> 03:34:36.193
&lt;b&gt;yes, so that's this paper&lt;/b&gt;

03:34:36.193 --> 03:34:37.360
&lt;b&gt;did you find the answer&lt;/b&gt;

03:34:37.594 --> 03:34:38.261
&lt;b&gt;um, I couldn't find the answer&lt;/b&gt;

03:34:38.261 --> 03:34:39.963
&lt;b&gt;if I'd found the answer I wouldn't be sitting here&lt;/b&gt;

