&lt;b&gt;I think this is an ultimate question&lt;/b&gt;

03:34:41.631 --> 03:34:42.132
&lt;b&gt;mm-hmm&lt;/b&gt;

03:34:42.132 --> 03:34:45.035
&lt;b&gt;I don't think this is just a computer vision problem&lt;/b&gt;

03:34:45.402 --> 03:34:47.604
&lt;b&gt;or rather, what I actually want to say is&lt;/b&gt;

03:34:47.604 --> 03:34:49.206
&lt;b&gt;actually, the term computer vision&lt;/b&gt;

03:34:49.206 --> 03:34:50.774
&lt;b&gt;is also very interesting&lt;/b&gt;

03:34:50.774 --> 03:34:51.741
&lt;b&gt;it's called vision&lt;/b&gt;

