03:40:25.175 --> 03:40:28.144
&lt;b&gt;large scope of multimodal intelligence it has now&lt;/b&gt;

03:40:28.278 --> 03:40:31.748
&lt;b&gt;from the perspective of vision's development history&lt;/b&gt;

03:40:31.748 --> 03:40:33.183
&lt;b&gt;there are actually two axes&lt;/b&gt;

03:40:33.183 --> 03:40:35.251
&lt;b&gt;you can draw them — this axis&lt;/b&gt;

