&lt;b&gt;datasets like ImageNet appeared&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:06.683 --> 03:41:09.819
&lt;b&gt;it became a 256×256&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:09.819 --> 03:41:10.820
&lt;b&gt;level&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:10.820 --> 03:41:13.656
&lt;b&gt;doing classification, right&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:13.823 --> 03:41:14.858
&lt;b&gt;um, but at those times&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:14.858 --> 03:41:16.693
&lt;b&gt;things were relatively controllable&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:16.860 --> 03:41:17.861
&lt;b&gt;and then later&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:17.861 --> 03:41:21.598
&lt;b&gt;there were detection and segmentation&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:21.598 --> 03:41:24.367
&lt;b&gt;this more structured kind of&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:24.367 --> 03:41:25.535
&lt;b&gt;cognitive process&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:25.802 --> 03:41:27.537
&lt;b&gt;and these are compositions&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:27.870 --> 03:41:29.405
&lt;b&gt;and then later, right&lt;/b&gt;

