&lt;b&gt;if this axis continues to advance, it leads to&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:31.574 --> 03:41:33.977
&lt;b&gt;the rise of multimodal large-scale models&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:34.277 --> 03:41:36.145
&lt;b&gt;because of the introduction of multimodality&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:36.145 --> 03:41:38.848
&lt;b&gt;we can easily abandon many&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:38.882 --> 03:41:40.083
&lt;b&gt;of these specific&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:40.283 --> 03:41:42.785
&lt;b&gt;relatively rigid&lt;/b&gt;

