&lt;b&gt;task designs&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:44.087 --> 03:41:45.154
&lt;b&gt;this kind of task design&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:45.455 --> 03:41:47.557
&lt;b&gt;and now I can take an image&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:47.557 --> 03:41:49.359
&lt;b&gt;and ask all kinds of questions&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:49.359 --> 03:41:50.226
&lt;b&gt;suppose this thing&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:50.226 --> 03:41:51.961
&lt;b&gt;language as a great interface&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:52.061 --> 03:41:52.495
&lt;b&gt;can&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:52.495 --> 03:41:54.397
&lt;b&gt;or language as a great interface&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:54.497 --> 03:41:57.667
&lt;b&gt;it can help you solve many many problems&lt;/b&gt;

03:41:58.167 --> 03:42:00.837
&lt;b&gt;right, so you can see over this time&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:00.837 --> 03:42:01.604
&lt;b&gt;um, this axis&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:01.604 --> 03:42:03.373
&lt;b&gt;this axis, um&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:03.373 --> 03:42:08.678
&lt;b&gt;goes from simple to complex tasks&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:08.678 --> 03:42:09.879
&lt;b&gt;such an axis&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:10.213 --> 03:42:12.815
&lt;b&gt;but also an axis where language starts&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:12.815 --> 03:42:15.585
&lt;b&gt;gradually entering computer vision&lt;/b&gt;

