&lt;b&gt;there are two issues here&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:18.021 --> 03:42:20.857
&lt;b&gt;the first is that after language entered vision&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:20.857 --> 03:42:22.158
&lt;b&gt;it brought us enormous benefits&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:22.158 --> 03:42:24.260
&lt;b&gt;allowing us to freely define problems&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:24.260 --> 03:42:25.428
&lt;b&gt;we can ask anything&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:25.428 --> 03:42:26.496
&lt;b&gt;and we can get any answer&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:26.496 --> 03:42:27.297
&lt;b&gt;mm-hmm&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:27.797 --> 03:42:30.066
&lt;b&gt;but the second important risk is&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:30.066 --> 03:42:32.268
&lt;b&gt;language's involvement has led to&lt;/b&gt;

