03:42:40.576 --> 03:42:41.978
&lt;b&gt;unrelated to vision&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:42.278 --> 03:42:43.613
&lt;b&gt;purely a language problem&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:43.613 --> 03:42:44.414
&lt;b&gt;mm-hmm&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:44.547 --> 03:42:47.417
&lt;b&gt;from this perspective&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:47.483 --> 03:42:50.586
&lt;b&gt;um, of course I think, yes&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:50.586 --> 03:42:51.988
&lt;b&gt;vision seems to have become marginalized&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:51.988 --> 03:42:52.488
&lt;b&gt;mm-hmm, right&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:52.488 --> 03:42:53.690
&lt;b&gt;but of course I don't feel discouraged&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:53.690 --> 03:42:55.992
&lt;b&gt;I see it as an enormous opportunity&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:57.260 --> 03:42:59.395
&lt;b&gt;because in the end&lt;/b&gt;

03:42:59.395 --> 03:43:00.797
&lt;b&gt;if the problems you're solving now&lt;/b&gt;

03:43:00.797 --> 03:43:01.831
&lt;b&gt;are relatively simple&lt;/b&gt;

03:43:01.831 --> 03:43:02.632
&lt;b&gt;then it doesn't matter&lt;/b&gt;

03:43:02.632 --> 03:43:03.933
&lt;b&gt;problems you can solve with language&lt;/b&gt;

03:43:03.933 --> 03:43:05.768
&lt;b&gt;just use language to solve them&lt;/b&gt;

03:43:05.868 --> 03:43:07.136
&lt;b&gt;right, um&lt;/b&gt;

