03:44:03.659 --> 03:44:05.795
&lt;b&gt;right, because you have a leg&lt;/b&gt;

03:44:05.795 --> 03:44:08.631
&lt;b&gt;this is the so-called leg of visual representation&lt;/b&gt;

03:44:08.664 --> 03:44:10.733
&lt;b&gt;which is still&lt;/b&gt;

03:44:10.733 --> 03:44:11.667
