&lt;b&gt;isn't that also virtual&lt;/b&gt;

03:44:26.883 --> 03:44:28.818
&lt;b&gt;oh, I think the word virtual may not be right&lt;/b&gt;

03:44:29.018 --> 03:44:29.952
&lt;b&gt;what I define as real&lt;/b&gt;

03:44:29.952 --> 03:44:32.755
&lt;b&gt;is something that has to interact with the real world&lt;/b&gt;

03:44:33.423 --> 03:44:34.690
&lt;b&gt;yes, what does that mean&lt;/b&gt;

03:44:34.690 --> 03:44:35.658
&lt;b&gt;meaning, look&lt;/b&gt;

03:44:35.658 --> 03:44:38.094
