&lt;b&gt;now for example these video diffusion models&lt;/b&gt;

03:50:10.292 --> 03:50:11.827
&lt;b&gt;have some Scaling Behavior&lt;/b&gt;

03:50:11.861 --> 03:50:12.495
&lt;b&gt;what's called Scaling&lt;/b&gt;

03:50:12.495 --> 03:50:13.863
&lt;b&gt;is that you can consume the data&lt;/b&gt;

03:50:14.096 --> 03:50:15.598
&lt;b&gt;yes, and then you can&lt;/b&gt;

03:50:15.598 --> 03:50:16.332
