03:50:16.332 --> 03:50:17.633
&lt;b&gt;you can get better results&lt;/b&gt;

03:50:17.767 --> 03:50:18.467
&lt;b&gt;right&lt;/b&gt;

03:50:18.467 --> 03:50:21.237
&lt;b&gt;or rather&lt;/b&gt;

03:50:21.237 --> 03:50:22.271
&lt;b&gt;this more formal characterization&lt;/b&gt;

03:50:22.271 --> 03:50:23.372
&lt;b&gt;meaning your Scaling Behavior&lt;/b&gt;

03:50:23.372 --> 03:50:25.741
&lt;b&gt;meaning if you now have a Transformer system&lt;/b&gt;

03:50:26.041 --> 03:50:27.676
&lt;b&gt;then I now satisfy this&lt;/b&gt;

