&lt;b&gt;put my hand in the fire&lt;/b&gt;

04:13:18.112 --> 04:13:19.080
&lt;b&gt;this thing&lt;/b&gt;

04:13:19.080 --> 04:13:22.316
&lt;b&gt;this kind of prediction structure&lt;/b&gt;

04:13:22.316 --> 04:13:24.986
