&lt;b&gt;how far I am from my ultimate goal&lt;/b&gt;

04:14:39.060 --> 04:14:40.228
&lt;b&gt;how far the distance is&lt;/b&gt;

04:14:40.795 --> 04:14:42.230
&lt;b&gt;so this algorithm is very simple&lt;/b&gt;

04:14:42.230 --> 04:14:45.266
&lt;b&gt;you continuously sample your action sequence&lt;/b&gt;

04:14:45.299 --> 04:14:47.034
