05:50:43.185 --> 05:50:46.021
&lt;b&gt;the 1975 one&lt;/b&gt;

05:50:46.021 --> 05:50:47.889
&lt;b&gt;or the one from the early 2000s?&lt;/b&gt;

05:50:47.889 --> 05:50:48.457
&lt;b&gt;I felt&lt;/b&gt;

05:50:48.457 --> 05:50:49.458
&lt;b&gt;I found the right person&lt;/b&gt;

05:50:49.458 --> 05:50:51.026
&lt;b&gt;was it the Tarkovsky one or&lt;/b&gt;

05:50:51.026 --> 05:50:52.294
&lt;b&gt;the Soderbergh one, right?&lt;/b&gt;

05:50:52.361 --> 05:50:54.463
&lt;b&gt;and I said, OK&lt;/b&gt;

05:50:54.463 --> 05:50:56.064
&lt;b&gt;I think, mm-hmm&lt;/b&gt;

05:50:56.064 --> 05:50:57.499
&lt;b&gt;I don't just admire you for your research&lt;/b&gt;

05:50:57.499 --> 05:50:59.968
&lt;b&gt;it seems you also know more than me about film&lt;/b&gt;

05:50:59.968 --> 05:51:00.669
&lt;b&gt;mm-hmm&lt;/b&gt;

05:51:00.669 --> 05:51:02.704
&lt;b&gt;I think&lt;/b&gt;

05:51:02.704 --> 05:51:05.173
&lt;b&gt;that's one thing&lt;/b&gt;

